sections.body:
[fast-check 官方入门](https://fast-check.dev/docs/introduction/getting-started/) 将测试分成输入生成器、性质和执行器，并介绍失败后的 shrinking。缩减目标是得到更易解释的反例；不要把结果宣称为所有输入中的全局最小值。本期固定使用 [v4.10.2](https://github.com/dubzzz/fast-check/releases/tag/v4.10.2)，文档于 2026-11-01 核验，属于长期工具教程，不是今日发布新闻。

在一个独立练习目录运行 npm install --save-dev --save-exact fast-check@4.10.2，保留 lockfile。将下列完整代码保存为 transfer-properties.mjs，用 node transfer-properties.mjs 运行。本次实际环境是 Node.js 22.16.0；无需安装 Cocos 或测试框架。broken 是故意保留的错误版，transfer 是修复版。

```javascript
/**
 * @file Reproduce and shrink an inventory transfer bug with independent rule properties.
 * @author liliwei
 * @date 2026-11-01
 * @LastEditors liliwei
 * @LastEditTime 2026-11-01
 */
import fc from 'fast-check';

const CAP = 10;
const quantity = fc.integer({ min: 0, max: CAP });

/** @param {number} a Source count. @param {number} b Destination count.
 * @param {number} n Requested count. @returns {number[]} Deliberately broken counts. */
export function broken(a, b, n) {
  const moved = Math.min(a, n);
  return [a - moved, Math.min(CAP, b + moved)];
}

/** @param {number} a Source count. @param {number} b Destination count.
 * @param {number} n Requested count. @returns {number[]} Counts after a legal transfer. */
export function transfer(a, b, n) {
  const moved = Math.min(a, n, CAP - b);
  return [a - moved, b + moved];
}

/** Check trusted integer inputs in 0..10 against rules, without copying the transfer formula.
 * @param {Function} fn Candidate operation. @param {number} a Source count.
 * @param {number} b Destination count. @param {number} n Requested count.
 * @returns {boolean} Whether bounds, conservation, direction and completion hold. */
export function followsRules(fn, a, b, n) {
  const [left, right] = fn(a, b, n);
  const moved = a - left;
  return [left, right].every(x => Number.isInteger(x) && x >= 0 && x <= CAP)
    && left + right === a + b
    && moved >= 0 && moved <= n
    && (moved === n || left === 0 || right === CAP);
}

/** @param {Function} fn Candidate operation. @returns {object} Generated rule property. */
export function property(fn) {
  return fc.property(quantity, quantity, quantity,
    (a, b, n) => followsRules(fn, a, b, n));
}

const options = { seed: 20261101, numRuns: 1000 };
const failure = fc.check(property(broken), options);
console.log(JSON.stringify({ failed: failure.failed, seed: failure.seed,
  path: failure.counterexamplePath, example: failure.counterexample,
  runs: failure.numRuns, shrinks: failure.numShrinks }));
fc.assert(property(transfer), options);
console.log('fixed: passed 1000 generated cases');
```

代码只接受合同范围内的可信整数；followsRules 是输出检查器，不是外部输入校验器。生产入口仍要拒绝 NaN、负数、小数、越界数量和无效格子，不能直接把字符串转成数字后无条件调用。
